{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t中方公布，總理李強將於10月17日至18日，正式訪問烏茲別克。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n李強隨後會在10月18日至20日，對塔吉克進行正式訪問並出席上海合作組織成員國政府首腦（總理）理事會第25次會議。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n李強並將於10月20日至22日前往俄羅斯，舉行中俄總理第31次定期會晤。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：盧曉珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T08:43:35.119785+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 大中華","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T08:21:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T13:18:20.996932+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T08:37:39.088096+00:00","content_hash":"90ab941b869e232e6e57aedf08fb6de8f30a271bbebc2d48db0bcfbcfdc21fea","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}